{
    "title": "Mall Blitz",
    "description": "Welcome to <b>Mall Blitz</b>, the ultimate match 3 puzzle adventure in a vibrant shopping mall! Take charge, solve match 3D puzzles, fulfill orders, and scale up your shopping empire. Once you start playing, you\u2019ll be back every day!\r\n\r\n<b>Your mission</b>: Sort through tangled items, match 3D objects, and complete shopping orders before time runs out. Each level brings a unique shopping list to fulfill, turning every request a blitz test of your strategy and wit. Dive into the fun of matching as Mall Blitz isn\u2019t just a game - it\u2019s a thrilling journey through a shopping wonderland packed with endless surprises and excitement!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f<b>How to Play</b>\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fFind, sort, and match 3D objects to complete shopping orders\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fGather and collect all requested items on shopping lists within the given time\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fActivate powerful boosters to blast through tough levels and clear obstacle\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fUnlock new mall items by wining more levels\r\n\u25aa\ufe0fJoin mesmerizing Weekly challenges and compete in the Mall Pass to earn exclusive rewards\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udecd<b>Mall Blitz Features</b> \ud83d\udecd\r\n\ud83d\udd051000+ of fun and challenging levels to keep you hooked\r\n\ud83d\udca0 Stunning 3D graphics that bring the mall to life\r\n\ud83d\udd05 Cool boosters to help tackle tricky match 3D levels\r\n\ud83d\udca0 No ads game with no ad interruption anymore, enjoy a seamless match 3D experience in this matching game\r\n\ud83d\udd05 Diverse shopping items range from a factory, grocery store to supermarket, and more, there\u2019s always something new to discover as you shop through the mall!\r\n\ud83d\udca0 Partner with brands! Unlock exclusive and unique items from top brands to your mall \r\n\ud83d\udd05 Uplifting music and cheerful sound effects make your journey relaxing and filled with bliss!\r\n\ud83d\udca0 Perfect match for all players - whether seasoned puzzle pro or new to match-3 games, you\u2019ll love matching challenges\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in Mall Blitz, where captivating match 3 games and puzzle surprises await your keen eye and sharp mind! Embark on this exciting match 3D journey, showcase your matching skills to the world! and prove yourself as the Master of Mall Puzzles! Bliss is just a level away!\r\n\r\n<i>The Mall is open - Start Matching Today!</i>\r\n\r\nFor any questions or support, contact us at support@matchgames.io. We\u2019re always here for you",
